>Home</title><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.3aqoeyw8yiuqx.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/theme-init.js\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><byoc-registration components=\"[]\" datasources=\"[]\"></byoc-registration><div class=\"prod-mode\"><header><div id=\"header\"><div class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"shell site-header__inner\"><span class=\"wordmark\">Koven</span><nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Sections\"><ul class=\"nav__list\"><li><a href=\"#disciplines\" title=\"\" target=\"\">Disciplines</a></li><li><a href=\"#work\" title=\"\" target=\"\">Work</a></li><li><a href=\"#practice\" title=\"\" target=\"\">Practice</a></li><li><a href=\"#contact\" title=\"\" target=\"\">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><div class=\"theme-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Colour theme\"><button type=\"button\" data-theme=\"light\" aria-pressed=\"false\">light</button><button type=\"button\" data-theme=\"system\" aria-pressed=\"true\">system</button><button type=\"button\" data-theme=\"dark\" aria-pressed=\"false\">dark</button></div></div></div></div></header><main><div id=\"content\"><section class=\"band band--hero\" id=\"top\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"hero__grid grid\"><div><h1 class=\"hero__title\">A small practice that designs quiet brands.</h1><div class=\"hero__body\"><p>Koven is two designers working across identity, editorial and interface. We stay small on purpose: the person who takes the brief is the person who draws the work. Most of what we make is a system rather than a single artefact, so it still holds a few years after we hand it over.</p></div><div class=\"hero__cta\"><a href=\"#work\" class=\"link-cta\" title=\"\" target=\"\">See the work</a></div></div><div><svg class=\"art art--hero\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 130 A110 110 0 0 1 130 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path><path d=\"M20 215 A195 195 0 0 1 215 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path><path d=\"M20 300 A280 280 0 0 1 300 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path><rect class=\"art__mark\" x=\"152.4\" y=\"152.4\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\"></rect></svg></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band\" id=\"disciplines\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"band__grid grid\"><h2 class=\"band__label\">Disciplines</h2><div class=\"services grid\"><article class=\"service\"><h3 class=\"service__title\">Identity</h3><div class=\"service__body\"><p>Marks, naming and type, drawn once and documented properly, so the next person to use them does not have to guess.</p></div></article><article class=\"service\"><h3 class=\"service__title\">Editorial</h3><div class=\"service__body\"><p>Annual reports, guides and books. The reading order gets designed before the pages do, because nobody reads a long document the way it was bound.</p></div></article><article class=\"service\"><h3 class=\"service__title\">Interface</h3><div class=\"service__body\"><p>Websites, portals and booking flows. Most of a project is spent taking screens away, not adding them. It takes longer. It reads better.</p></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band\" id=\"work\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"band__grid grid\"><h2 class=\"band__label\">Work</h2><div class=\"work\"><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Identity</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">Identity for a regional bakery group, from mark to packaging.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2025</span></div><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Editorial</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">An annual report rebuilt around one idea, cover to colophon.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2024</span></div><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Interface</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">A booking interface for a small hospitality group, simplified until it explained itself.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2024</span></div><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Editorial</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">A field guide for a co-operative, printed in one colour.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2023</span></div><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Identity</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">A visual system for a photography studio that had outgrown its first one.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2022</span></div><div class=\"work__row grid\"><h3 class=\"work__discipline\">Interface</h3><p class=\"work__summary\">A member portal for a trade association, redrawn from the ground up.</p><span class=\"work__year\">2021</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band band--sunk\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"band__grid grid\"><h2 class=\"band__label\">Practice</h2><div class=\"stats grid\"><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">2</span><span class=\"stat__label\">people</span></div><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">3</span><span class=\"stat__label\">disciplines</span></div><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">1</span><span class=\"stat__label\">page</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"band__grid grid\"><h2 class=\"band__label\">Contact</h2><div class=\"contact__inner\"><div><a href=\"mailto:hello@koven.studio\" class=\"link-big\" title=\"\" target=\"\">hello@koven.studio</a></div><span class=\"contact__art\"><svg class=\"art art--mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 130 A110 110 0 0 1 130 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path><path d=\"M20 215 A195 195 0 0 1 215 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\"